  "details": "Strangely this one is reproducible even in editor so I was able to get some error logs. It behaves exactly the same in game as it does in editor which honestly I did not expect. In editor I can repro by moving my avatar 1000 meters from origin, in game I can repro by using the floating point error world and just going to the 1000m room: https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_b9f80349-74af-4840-8ce9-a1b783436590 Though this seems to also be reproducible at as little as 600m.\n\nRight now it only happens on one particular physbone on one particular avatar. Not even identical copies on the same avatar seem to experience this issue. Will update with more info once I have a clean repro.",
